    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present to the market 5 Riversdale Grove. An exceptional 1930s red brick, bay-windowed family home which has been thoughtfully extended to an exacting standard. Presented in immaculate condition, generous ceiling heights, he property seamlessly combines elegant contemporary interiors with a wealth of original period features. \r\n\r\nIdeally positioned within a peaceful cul-de-sac off Kimmage Road Lower, the property enjoys a wonderfully convenient setting with a host of cafés, restaurants, local shops and amenities close by while Kimmage and Terenure villages are within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe generously proportioned accommodation is arranged over two floors and has been carefully designed to provide a versatile and light-filled environment for modern family living. The welcoming entrance hall with cloakroom off. To the front of the property is the living room boasting an open fireplace, ceiling coving, solid timber flooring and folding doors opening through to the dining area. The beautifully appointed family/dining space features bespoke alcove shelving, further ceiling coving, solid timber flooring and double doors opening directly onto the rear garden. The bespoke architect designed kitchen extension with  an extensive range of cabinetry, quality appliances, 1 1/3 sink and solid walnut counters, shelving and a flush glazed rooflight above. A guest WC, utility area and further door to the garden complete the ground floor. \r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, comprising two generous doubles and a single room. The principal bedroom sits to the rear of the property with built-in wardrobes, while bedrooms two and three are positioned to the front. A stylish family bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\nTo the front is a lawn is bordered by mature hedging providing an attractive approach and excellent privacy. The beautifully landscaped rear garden is a particular feature of the property designed with ease of maintenance and outdoor entertaining in mind. With paved patio area patio leads to raised planting beds and a dedicated BBQ area, while a substantial concrete shed provides excellent additional storage. Rear pedestrian access further enhances the practicality of this superb home.\r\nOutside is to the front are gardens in lawn with mature hedging offering a high degree of privacy. To the rear is beautifully landscaped garden with low maintenance paved patio, raised beds, BBQ area, concrete shed for additional storage and rear pedestrian access.\r\n\r\nRiversdale Grove is a small, quiet tranquil cul de sac located off Lower Kimmage Road and within easy reach of the city centre, Terenure, Kimmage, Harold’s Cross and Templeogue are all within walking distance to the property with their wide variety of cafes, shops, bars and restaurants. The area enjoys a wide selection of primary and secondary schools. There are ample green spaces and parks including Bushy Park and Eamonn Ceannt Park closeby. Transport links are ideal with a number of bus routes on Kimmage Road Lower linking to the city centre and further afield. The location offers quick and easy to both the city and M50.\r\n\r\nThis is an immaculate property in a highly accessible and popular residential location, viewing is recommended!"
      },
